{"kind": "mod", "id": 923, "name": "MFAC Gear", "slug": "mfac-gear", "teaser": "Just a bunch of custom rigs and a bag", "owner_name": "Pettan", "downloads": 10630, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:47.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-06-16T20:46:26.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-06-16T20:46:26.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.8.0", "latest_version": "2.7.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>YOU NEED</p>\n<p>AND</p>\n<p>FOR THIS TO WORK</p>\n<p>This mod recycles existing vanilla assets.</p>\n<p>This mod adds new gear to Alice LL1</p>\n<p>MFAC Waist Pouch</p>\n<p>MFAC Commando chest harness (Desert Tan)</p>\n<p>MFAC Wartech</p>\n<p>MFAC MPPV</p>\n<p>MFAC Trooper 80 backpack</p>\n<p>v2.0.0 content</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/L0hw09K/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/x6pttCN/image.png\" alt=\"image.png\" /></p>\n<p>This mod wouldn’t be possible without Mighty_Condor’s code as the framework.</p>\n<p><strong>Installation:</strong></p>\n<p>First install my custom trader and MFAC Armor Inserts</p>\n<p>Extract with 7zip (<strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.7-zip.org/</a></strong>)</p>\n<p>Extract folder in 7z file to your mods folder</p>\n<p>The directory should look like this:</p>\n<p>/user/mods/aaMFACSHOP/</p>\n<p>/user/mods/Armor_Inserts_MFAC/</p>\n<p>/user/mods/Gear_MFAC_Equipment/</p>\n<p><strong>Known Issues:</strong><br />\nThe waist pack might be buggy?</p>\n<p><strong>Uninstalling:</strong></p>\n<p>If you want to remove the mod make sure to not have any of the added items in your profile before deleting the folder.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.7.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3852, "published_at": "2023-10-10T11:19:43.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/923/mfac-gear/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1355, "published_at": "2024-04-14T12:40:33.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/923/mfac-gear/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "2.7.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1839, "published_at": "2024-05-02T10:18:30.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/923/mfac-gear/2.7.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": []}